	quest.22E4569D2BAB1DC5.quest_desc: ["magnets can be made in a polariser. this machine does need a magnet to craft. you can get your first magnets by striking the magnetic alloy with lightning."]
	quest.23FC7A691F9B6707.quest_subtitle: "are you gonna bother with this ?"
	quest.2DFAC6A19C77C96E.quest_subtitle: "(ab)using the particle accelerator can cause an incursion. Colliding enderpearls with 10000J can create a portal to the end."
	quest.2E5CCCB1FFD4348C.quest_desc: ["to get fireclay you must break a fireclay block. this is found underground."]
	quest.38C8243AF3557A81.quest_desc: [
		"getting crushing wheels will drastically improve your metal gathering. Using strange stones you can get most crushed metals. These stones generate underground but they also form \"vents\". Dormant vents can be awakened with an explosion nearby. when active they will convert lava (or liquid asphalt for lignite) into the respective stone."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/font/icons/vent.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.411CC0C3E4858D74.quest_subtitle: "these goggles will help a lot with TFMG multiblocks."
	quest.4945733F17C7959E.quest_desc: ["A coke oven makes cokes out of coal. Unlike what you see in the ponder, this oven is not a multiblock. Pump CO2 out of the top, extract creosote from anywhere else. "]
	quest.4C938F405EB4DF2C.quest_desc: [
		"There is (almost) no underground ore generation. To help get you started there  are surface boulders riddled with ores. These are easy to spot using the minimap. Look for dark gray blobs of deepslate on the surface and they will guide you to the boulders you are looking for."
		"{image:kubejs:textures/font/icons/boulder.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
	]
	quest.4C938F405EB4DF2C.title: "Don't dig down."
	quest.531B3D71E6F93799.quest_subtitle: "be careful, ancient debris is only found in chests."
	quest.558A027ECDB9F2B4.quest_subtitle: "source of lead"
	quest.5C01F74E0E433EEA.quest_subtitle: "there are several ways to get platinum. most of them are some part of the nickel processing line."
	quest.5C1261B6FBDB423B.quest_subtitle: "source of nickel"
	quest.609619FCE24F7B88.quest_desc: ["Put 2 blaststoves ontop of eachother. pump creosote in the bottom, air in the side. out of the top you can pump hot air and out of the side of the bottom block you can remove the co2"]
